<title>INDONESIA: Lippo Karawaci full year net soars.</title>
<headline>Lippo Karawaci full year net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		101   vs    70.63</p>
<p>    Total equity	    465   vs    249</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Lippo Karawaci is a property developer belonging to the Lippo Group. It was listed in June this year.</p>
